on single line or double line, the line shall not be considered clear and Line Clear shall not be given, unless-

(a) the whole of the last preceding train has arrived complete ;

(b) all signals have been put back to ‘on’ behind the said train ;

(c) the line on which it is intended to receive the incoming train is clear upto the Starter ; and

(d) all p oints have been correctly set and all facing points have been locked for the admission of the train on the said line.

